// The legionaries on the depot gate.
=== start
[flag depot_pass] -> inside
"Keep moving." He doesn't look at you. He's looking at the rain, which he has been looking at for a month.
* "What's in there?" -> what
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== what
"Grain. Horses. Money. Children." He counts them off as if they were all the same kind of thing, which for him they are. "And me, out here. Keep moving."
-> END

=== inside
"You've been let in." He says it as if somebody else will be blamed for it. "Don't touch the horses."
-> END
